// go.work — the Go workspace (24 §2 + 24 §8).
// T01 ships the go-version line only. T02 adds the first `use` directive: the contract
// module (pkg/contracts/go.mod — github.com/engenox/contracts) lands at T02, so it enters
// the workspace now; generated/go/ compiles within that module. The service modules
// (`use ./services/perception`, `./services/action`, `./services/gateway`) land at T11
// alongside their go.mod files — until then this workspace has one member.
// `go work sync` on a single-member workspace is a no-op that exits 0.
go 1.24.0

use (
	./pkg/contracts
)
